  P(X=2) &= 0.47\times(1-0.47) = 0.2491 \\
  P(X=3) &= 0.47\times(1-0.47)^2 = 0.132 \\
  P(X=4) &= 0.47\times(1-0.47)^3 = 0.07 \\
  \end{aligned}\] Então, \(k= 3\).

